rdion#customization","content":"Use `className` and `style` to customize the group container. `data-disabled` reflects the group's\ndisabled state. Customize individual headings, triggers, and panels on the composed Collapsible sections."},"56":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-32","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"Key"},"57":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-33","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"Action"},"58":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-34","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"`Tab` / `Shift + Tab`"},"59":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-35","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"Move between enabled triggers and controls in expanded panels"},"60":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-36","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"`Enter` / `Space`"},"61":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-37","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"Toggle the focused section; focus stays on the trigger"},"62":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-38","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#aria","content":"Each section's trigger is a native button with `aria-expanded` and `aria-controls` linked to its panel."},"63":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-39","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#aria","content":"Each panel is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."},"64":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-40","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/