s."],[569,"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."],[1386,"**`ButtonGroup`** - a cluster of related actions (a wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`). Overlay parents like `Modal` adopt it with end alignment and padding."],[1383,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[291,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1385,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1387,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1384,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[677,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[676,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[684,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[685,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[683,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1661,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1124,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[665,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1822,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[669,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1390,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1611,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1659,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1171,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1720,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1297,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[881,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[880,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1172,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[1843,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[662,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[716,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[1839,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[1838,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[667,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[1841,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1744,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[1975,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[740,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[1877,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[1872,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[1874,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[1873,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[738,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[1876,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[285,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[284,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[724,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[664,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1610,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[485,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1327,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[970,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1329,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant