t**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[741,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[729,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[714,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[663,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1334,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[717,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1840,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1852,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1724,"**Home**"],[1855,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1844,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[2034,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[2025,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[692,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[732,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1818,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[290,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[289,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1847,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[833,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1743,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1880,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[728,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1842,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[745,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1846,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1614,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[739,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1123,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[661,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[726,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[743,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[736,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1168,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1167,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[835,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1335,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[2062,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[727,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[722,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon